    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Requires Attunement by a character with renown in the Ashen Verdict.</em></p><p>This thick metal band bears a skull whose eyes are two luminous blue gems. The forge mark of Ormus the Penitent, a stylized O, is stamped inside it.</p><p>While wearing this ring, you gain the following benefits (Ashen Verdict renown required in parentheses).</p><p><strong>Destruction (Uncommon, Renown 3+).</strong> You gain a +1 bonus to spell attack rolls, and your spell save DC increases by 1.</p><p><strong>Greater Destruction (Rare, Renown 10+).</strong> The bonus to spell attack rolls and the increase to your spell save DC become +2.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-PiDtJBmVsAS66TUz\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>For the Endless tier, turn on the effect of your spellcasting ability only.</p></section>",
